      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/5e9695/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-09-30T19:17:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There is a great iPad ap that I use. It has all villains, heroes, villain targets, heroe targets and environment tArgets with HP. There is a max HP and current HP row so you can keep track of both at the same time. It is only a dollar and works great. Only issue is that it doesn't reset for baron blades but you can do that yourself. The layout also works great for everyone since the heroes can be rotated to suit where people are sitting.</p>",
